sentences.text:
Let the applicant Vikki @ Brijesh Maurya involved in Special Case No. 68 of 2021 in connection with Case Crime No. 30 of 2021, under Sections 363, 366, 376, 506 IPC and Section 5/6 POCSO Act,
Police Station Mehnagar, District Azamgarh, be released on bail on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of the court concerned with the following conditions;
(i) The applicant shall file an undertaking to the effect that he shall not seek any adjournment on the dates fixed for evidence when the witnesses are present in court.

